# Purpose: Convert a simple unquoted comma-separated supplier feed into tab-separated form for a downstream importer.
# Inputs: imports/suppliers.csv: unquoted CSV with no embedded commas or quotes.
# Outputs: staging/suppliers.tsv: tab-separated supplier rows; stdout echoes the converted feed.
accept suppliers_path as text with default "imports/suppliers.csv"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["staging"]
run cat with path suppliers_path
pipe to tr with from "," and to "\t"
then save to "staging/suppliers.tsv"
